              supported: true,
              description: 'Ask one opponent for a specific card by value and suit. Valid only if you hold another card in that half-suit, the asked player has at least one card, and you do not ask for a card in your own hand. If they have it they give it to you and you keep the turn; if not, turn passes to them.',
